					<![CDATA[
						 <p>The Great Tie Plague continues to complicate things. Since a 4-way match would be a mite excessive and there are 12 remaining contestants, I'll be shuffling folks into 6 random<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-924508-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >1</a></sup> pairs.</p> <p>I apologize for the inconvenience if anyone had been making story plans based on future matchups. There will be extra writing time next round to compensate, and any future ties in this tournament will be broken per executive decision.</p> <p>Round 3 matchups are up! Note that Kaktus technicaly won, but retired from the competition, so psul progresses by default.</p> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class="title">Footnotes</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-924508-1"><a href="javascript:;" >1</a>. For transparency: I'll be selecting one of three randomly generated sets.</div> </div> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
