					<![CDATA[
						 <p>My only objection is that the numbers next to the entries look like seeds, and somehow I don't think Kaktus is 17th seeded in this tournament, or that Kinch is 25th. If nobody would be offended by the comparison, you might consider actually organizing these by seeds (1-16, two authors per seed), organized by author votecount or average. I don't think anybody would object to an objective ranking of each author's overall popularity/productivity/skill, and it would help track any <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cinderella_(sports)">Cinderella stories</a> that come out of the competition.</p> <p>Everything looks great, though. Awesome job.</p> 
				 	]]>
